        (source "pcb-a-power.kicad_sch")
        (comment (number "1") (value "Phase A65 schematic (appendix 32.55 and 32.56: the BB-2590/U node, LM5176 front end and PA and PoE rails, BQ25731 charger, per-slot TPS56637 rails, TPS55288 HF and PD stages, hardware EMCON gates, eleven blind-mate sites), generated by tools/gen_sch_a.py. Netlist style: every pin carries a stub and a net label."))
        (comment (number "2") (value "MESHSAT-709 / MESHSAT-789. A19 (4 Sep 2026 rulings, appendix 32.13 to 32.25): the kit UPS. BQ25792 charger from the dock 12 V, BQ34Z100-G1 gauge, three TPS61288L rails (M1, M2, Pi), LTC2954 main power control, TPS259571 heating-pad switch, USB2517I seven-port hub with the wall host port, PCA9555 0x21 and 0x24, seven SMP-MAX blind-mate sites, 9 A power pins to the floor battery module. No X1202."))
